{"idx": 540, "model": "claude-sonnet", "prompt": "p3_analyst_rules", "source": "presconf", "orig_row": 157, "gold": 0, "pred": 2, "raw": "Looking at this sentence:\n\n- It notes that inflation and unemployment are near their longer-run normal values (balanced/neutral observation)\n- However, the key point is that the federal funds rate projection (2%) is **well below** the longer-run normal value (~4%), indicating rates remain accommodative/below normal\n\nThe phrase \"well below the longer-run normal value\" signals that policy remains accommodative \u2014 rates are being kept lower than their neutral level, which is a dovish signal.\n\n**0**", "in_tok": 324, "out_tok": 110, "cost": 0.002622, "error": null}
